	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  curseur dans un curseur]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=6405#p6405"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Pour ce qui est du code qui boucle :</p><p>WHILE FOUND LOOP<br />&#160; RAISE NOTICE &#039;%,%,%&#039;, id, req, lib;<br /> END LOOP;</p><p>FOUND ne risque pas de changer dans la boucle…</p><p>Vous devez faire un FETCH dans une boucle.</p><p>Je l&#039;écris de cette façon habituellement :</p><p>LOOP&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br />&#160; FETCH v_cursor INTO v_record;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br />&#160; EXIT WHEN NOT FOUND; -- on est arrivés à la fin du curseur&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; <br /> …<br />END LOOP</p>]]></content>
